--- dot() with options: (none)
global_atomic_cmpswap: 1   global_atomic_add_f32: 0
in loop .LBB0_2: v_pk_mul_f32: 2   v_fma*/v_fmac*: 0   v_add_f32: 4
--- dot() with options: -munsafe-fp-atomics
global_atomic_cmpswap: 0   global_atomic_add_f32: 1
in loop .LBB0_2: v_pk_mul_f32: 2   v_fma*/v_fmac*: 0   v_add_f32: 4
--- dot() with options: -ffp-contract=fast
global_atomic_cmpswap: 1   global_atomic_add_f32: 0
in loop .LBB0_2: v_pk_mul_f32: 2   v_fma*/v_fmac*: 0   v_add_f32: 4
